            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Snapbar 0.3</h2>
<ul>
  <li>The window picker appears instantly after you choose it.</li>
  <li>Cut in the editor: click the scissors, then click the strip where it should split.</li>
  <li>Redesigned editor panel: every option is a button on the panel, with tips on hover. Click the speed and quality pills to change them.</li>
  <li>Esc no longer stops a recording.</li>
  <li>The size readout while dragging an area matches the rest of the glass interface.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
